-
-Video 002’s v019 and v020 were rejected: controls and small movements on drawings already frozen mid-action did not reproduce the accepted first batch’s acting. Use a complete neutral drawing fitted to its own joints for a continuous gesture performance; author preparation, contact and recovery. Use matched action drawings where the intended view or extreme movement needs them, as in the Bruno proof. Keep recognizable whole-character artwork, garment joins, planted feet and timing together. v021 reconstructs all sixteen new player roles using the v016 construction, retaining the accepted Arteta/Gyokeres performances and sound. It remains a review candidate; see [its evidence and limitations](videos/002-how-arsenal-won-the-league/artifacts/defence-v021/README.md).
